thorRole": "reviewer", "body": "Good fit for the queue. Before I can score it, two things: what''s the current ticket-to-resolution baseline, and can you confirm the model sourcing? It''s marked unknown, which is a blocker under the EO.", "createdAt": "2026-06-04T14:00:00Z"}]}'::jsonb, 'needs_info', 'submitter@uspto.gov', 'trademarks')
